      other keys (e.g. id and position from an export) are ignored.
    pool: List of question dictionaries forming the pool

  Returns:
    Tuple of (success_count, failed_count) over the pool
  """
  <<create the question group>>
  <<warn about suspicious pool sizes>>
  <<create the pool questions in the group>>
  return success, failed
